{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21834","headline":"通州丁溪馆夜别李景信三首 一 · 元稹","name":"通州丁溪馆夜别李景信三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月蒙蒙兮山掩掩，束束别魂眉歛歛。\n蠡琖覆时天欲明，碧幌青灯风灩灩。\n泪消语尽还暂眠，唯梦千山万山险。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}